# Rebuild Chrome and Yandex packs after every change

Unpacked Chrome loads from `dist/` (new tab override). Yandex cannot load `chrome_url_overrides`, so it needs `dist-yandex/` without that key.

After any edit that affects the extension, produce **both** before finishing. Do not rebuild only Chrome.

Applies to: `src/**`, `public/**`, `index.html`, `vite.config.*`, Tailwind/PostCSS, `package.json`, `scripts/pack-yandex.mjs`.

```bash
npm run pack:all
```

Wait until it exits. It builds `dist/`, zips `bookmark-manager.zip` (Chrome), then `dist-yandex/` and `bookmark-manager-yandex.zip` (Yandex, icon-only, no newtab).

A `build:watch` / `dev:extension` watcher updates only `dist/`. That does **not** count as the Yandex build — still run `npm run pack:all` (or at least `npm run pack:yandex` after dist is current).

Do not skip this for small UI or copy changes.
